BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Guarini Walk Around Occom Pond - Postdoc Appreciation
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260923T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260923T130000
DTSTAMP:20260924T032428Z
UID:guarini-50910@free-food-dartmouth
SEQUENCE:0
CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:Original event page(s):\nhttps://guarinigrad.dartmouth.edu/eve
 nts/2026/09/23/guarini-walk-around-occom-pond-postdoc-appreciation/\nhttps
 ://apply.gs.dartmouth.edu/register/?id=b7b99429-3e6b-44b9-b033-54e2243468d
 3\nhttps://guarinigrad.dartmouth.edu\n\nDescription:\nJoin the Director of
  Postdoc Affairs for a reflective walk around Occom Pond\, followed by a c
 offee or tea break at Ramekin. This event offers a chance to connect with 
 fellow postdocs\, graduate students\, and faculty in a relaxed\, natural s
 etting\, promoting well-being and community spirit. Invite your faculty ad
 visor or faculty mentor and you can both receive a $6 coupon for Ramekin a
 nd a Guarini mug will be provided to participants (limited to one each).\n
 Meet in front of the Guarini School\, Anonymous Hall – across from Ramek
 in Cafe.\nGuariniGrad Dialogues\nare a series of events designed to bring 
 graduate students\, postdocs\, and faculty together in informal settings t
 o foster empathy\, understanding\, and a deeper sense of community. By cre
 ating spaces where differing views\, perspectives\, and circumstances can 
 be shared and appreciated\, these dialogues aim to strengthen connections 
 within the Dartmouth community and foster a sense of belonging.\n*Guarini 
 graduate students include all PhD\, MA\, MALS\, MET\, and MFA students\; a
 nd MS students in Engineering\, Computer Science\, and Earth Sciences.\n\n
 Sponsor / organizer: GuariniGRAD\n\nAudience: Guarini graduate students an
 d postdocs\n\nSource: Guarini\n\nWhy this was included: food keyword near 
 service context in summary\n\nFood availability is inferred from the sourc
 e listing\; verify details before attending.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260924T032428Z
LOCATION:Anonymous Hall
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://guarinigrad.dartmouth.edu/events/2026/09/23/guarini-walk-aroun
 d-occom-pond-postdoc-appreciation/
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-BUSYSTATUS:FREE
END:VEVENT
