SUMMARY:DR. ALLEN W. ROOT DISTINGUISHED CONTEMPORARY ART LECTURESHIP
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260925T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260925T180000
DTSTAMP:20260924T032428Z
UID:dartmouth-81891@free-food-dartmouth
SEQUENCE:0
CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:Original event page(s):\nhttps://home.dartmouth.edu/events/eve
 nt?event=81891\n\nDescription:\nBarbara Takenaga\, Artist’s Talk\nKnown 
 for her immersive\, meticulous abstract paintings that draw upon the cosmi
 c as well as the scientific\, Barbara Takenaga will talk about influences 
 and ideas that have informed her practice over the last five decades. A re
