 rtmouth.edu\n\nDescription:\nJoin Water Scientist Ryan E. Emanuel for a Mo
 ntgomery Fellow lunch discussion\nRyan E. Emanuel is a hydrologist and com
 munity-engaged scholar at Duke University’s Nicholas School of the Envir
 onment\, where he is an associate professor of hydrology and co-chair of D
 uke’s program in Community Engagement and Environmental Justice.\nHis re
